OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright spells for a while
OL,6,Ffirst thing. However, showers
OL,7,Fspreading across the region as the day
OL,8,Fprogresses, some of these being heavy
OL,9,Fwith hail and thunder possible. A
OL,10,Fcooler northerly breeze developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers fading during the
OL,13,Fevening, then becoming largely dry
OL,14,Fovernight with clear spells and light
OL,15,Fwinds. A notably cooler night than of
OL,16,Flate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
