OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly dry on Friday with a
OL,6,Fgood number of sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers are possible, but these
OL,8,Flighter and more isolated than on
OL,9,FThursday. Feeling fresher than of late.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,13,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,14,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,15,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,16,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,17,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
